<h1>Why counting claims isn't enough to understand risk</h1>
<p class="lead">Two insurance teams can handle a similar number of claims but face very different financial exposure. I used a 10,000-claim dataset to investigate how claim values vary by insurance product, and why totals alone can lead to misleading comparisons.</p>

<section class="summary" aria-label="Evidence at a glance">
